<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-miller-ocular-dominance-stripes-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Miller, Keller & Stryker (1989) & Hubel, Wiesel & LeVay (1977) ocular dominance column development & plasticity — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 6 reference-anchored quantitative measurements via `measure_morphoeval()` (L469-540): normal binocular 2D FFT stripe wavelength (`806.19 um` vs `800.26 um` analytical reference), normal binocular left-eye fraction (`0.5036` vs `0.50` reference), Hubel-Wiesel monocular deprivation deprived-eye fraction (`0.2533` vs `0.24` reference), strabismus broadened wavelength (`883.82 um` vs `895.0 um` reference), inhibition range `sigma_I` wavelength scaling correlation (`r = 0.9970`, `RMSE = 13.36 um`), and specimen CV stripe fraction (`0.5000`, `71` branchpoints)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
